## Automated Validation Test Suite

Run the end-to-end verification script to confirm cluster readiness:

```bash
cd ~/cka/00-cluster-installation
./test-cluster-install.sh
```

Once the cluster is initialized, re-run `make preprod-cka-lab` or `make preprod-ha-cka-lab` from the host
machine to apply live in-cluster exercises (e.g. testing secrets, namespaces, and workloads).
